{
  "about": "Shared by tests/permission-parity.test.js (Config/permissionGuard.js) and frontend/tests/unit/permissionParity.spec.js (checkPermission). A case with no project is evaluated without one; otherwise the project document is stored with exactly the fields given. expected is the raw matrix value: null None, false read, true write, 1 Own, 2 Everyone.",
